SUMMARY:Panigiri of Sotiros (Transfiguration)\, Mantoudi
LOCATION:Mantoudi\, Evia (North)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Mantoudi's parish church is the Metamorfosi\, and on 6 August the food for the feast is cooked in cauldrons in the churchyard and shared after the liturgy\, with music in the square\; the municipality lists it each summer. A weekday-style village panigiri rather than a concert\, which is the point.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/evia-north/#mantoudi-panigiri-of-sotiros-transfiguration-mantoudi
